From dec1fd143f6160c87c5e569ffa07f09fe83e1399 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Deniz Kokden <koekdendeniz@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 22:35:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 027/110] ARM: sprd: SC2723 auxiliary ADC, battery temperature
 in the fuel gauge

A small IIO driver for the SC2723's auxiliary ADC (raw counts, one
software conversion at a time, sequence from the vendor kernel), and
the battery temperature in sc2723-fgu from the thermistor on ADC
channel 1 with the vendor's table. Outside the vendor's window (stop
at -5 / 58 C, resume at 0 / 53 C) the fuel gauge inhibits charging
through the charger's charge_behaviour and reports the health.

Tested on SM-T560: 28.4 C at room temperature (channel 1 = 2011),
inhibit-charge stops charging (-366 mA), auto resumes it (+287 mA).

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Deniz Kokden <koekdendeniz@gmail.com>
